      "biography": {
        "value": "<h2>Description</h2><p>This magnificent beast looks like a white horse but with a single long ivory horn on her brow.</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 15, touch 12, flat-footed 12 (+3 dex, +3 natural, -1 size)</p><p>hp 34 [52] (4d10+12)</p><p>Fort +7, Ref +7, Will +5</p><p>DR 5/cold iron</p><p>Resist Holy 5</p><p>Immune Charm, Compulsion, Poison</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed 60 ft.</p><p>Melee Gore +8 (2d6+4), 2 Hooves +5 (1d6+2)</p><p>Space 10 ft.; Reach 10 ft.</p><p>Special Attacks Bestial Fang, Powerful Charge (Gore, 3d6+8)</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>Str 18, Dex 17, Con 16, Int 4, Wis 18, Cha 18</p><p>Base Atk +4; CMB +9; CMD 22 (26 vs trip)</p><p>Feats Multiattack, Weapon Focus (horn)</p><p>Skills Acrobatics +8, Climb +9, Perception +9, Stealth +4, Survival +9; Racial Modifiers +3 Survival</p><p>SQ Magical Strike</p>"
